### Render PDF from HTML (Basic)
POST http://localhost:8080/render
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<h1>Hello</h1><p>PDF from HTML</p>",
  "name": "hello",
  "size": "A4",
  "orientation": "portrait",
  "margin": {
    "top": 0.4,
    "right": 0.4,
    "bottom": 0.4,
    "left": 0.4
  }
}

### Render PDF (Invoice with table + totals)
POST http://localhost:8080/render
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><style>body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0} .page{padding:24px} h1{margin:0 0 8px 0} .meta{color:#555;font-size:12px} table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:16px} th,td{border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:8px;text-align:left} th{background:#f6f6f6} .total{margin-top:16px;text-align:right;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold}</style></head><body><div class=\"page\"><h1>Invoice INV-2026-014</h1><div class=\"meta\">Date: 2026-02-14<br>Customer: Acme Corp</div><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Qty</th><th>Unit</th><th>Total</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Design sprint</td><td>1</td><td>$2,000</td><td>$2,000</td></tr><tr><td>Implementation</td><td>5</td><td>$800</td><td>$4,000</td></tr><tr><td>Support</td><td>10</td><td>$120</td><td>$1,200</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"total\">Total: $7,200</div></div></body></html>",
  "name": "invoice-2026-014",
  "size": "A4",
  "orientation": "portrait"
}

### Render PDF (Multi-page report with page breaks)
POST http://localhost:8080/render
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><style>body{font-family:Georgia,serif} h1{margin-top:0} .page{page-break-after:always} .kpi{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px} .card{border:1px solid #ccc;padding:12px;border-radius:6px} .bar{height:10px;background:#eee;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden} .bar>span{display:block;height:10px;background:#3b82f6}</style></head><body><div class=\"page\"><h1>Weekly Report</h1><div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"card\"><strong>Users</strong><div>12,840</div><div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width:78%\"></span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><strong>Conversions</strong><div>1,092</div><div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width:46%\"></span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><strong>Revenue</strong><div>$48,320</div><div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width:61%\"></span></div></div></div><p>Summary: Momentum is strong with improvements in signups and revenue.</p></div><div class=\"page\"><h1>Details</h1><p>Page 2 content. Add long text to force page wrapping. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed non risus. Suspendisse lectus tortor, dignissim sit amet, adipiscing nec, ultricies sed, dolor. Cras elementum ultrices diam. Maecenas ligula massa, varius a, semper congue, euismod non, mi.</p><p>More content. Curabitur vel lorem sit amet nulla ullamcorper fermentum. In vitae varius augue, eu consectetur ligula. Etiam dui erat, pretium ut ante sed, cursus iaculis erat.</p></div><div><h1>Appendix</h1><p>Final page without forced break.</p></div></body></html>",
  "name": "weekly-report",
  "size": "Letter",
  "orientation": "portrait"
}

### Render PDF (Landscape roadmap with timeline)
POST http://localhost:8080/render
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><style>body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif} .lane{margin:8px 0} .bar{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:4px;color:#fff;font-size:12px} .q1{background:#10b981} .q2{background:#f59e0b} .q3{background:#ef4444} .q4{background:#3b82f6} .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr} .ticks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);font-size:12px;color:#666;margin-bottom:6px}</style></head><body><h1>Product Roadmap 2026</h1><div class=\"ticks\"><div>Q1</div><div>Q2</div><div>Q3</div><div>Q4</div></div><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"lane\">Foundation</div><div class=\"lane\"><span class=\"bar q1\" style=\"width:22%\">Infra</span></div><div class=\"lane\">Growth</div><div class=\"lane\"><span class=\"bar q2\" style=\"width:30%\">Acquisition</span></div><div class=\"lane\">Scale</div><div class=\"lane\"><span class=\"bar q3\" style=\"width:28%\">Intl</span></div><div class=\"lane\">Polish</div><div class=\"lane\"><span class=\"bar q4\" style=\"width:25%\">UX</span></div></div></body></html>",
  "name": "roadmap-2026",
  "size": "A4",
  "orientation": "landscape"
}

