### Render PDF (Large invoice with inline logo)
POST http://localhost:8080/render
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><style>body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#111} .page{padding:28px} .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start} .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px} .logo img{width:64px;height:64px} .logo h1{margin:0;font-size:22px} .meta{font-size:12px;color:#555} .box{border:1px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;margin-top:16px} table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:12px} th,td{border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:8px;text-align:left;font-size:12px} th{background:#f7f7f7} .right{text-align:right} .totals{margin-top:16px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end} .totals table{width:280px} .badge{display:inline-block;background:#0ea5e9;color:#fff;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px} .notes{font-size:11px;color:#666;margin-top:12px} .footer{margin-top:20px;font-size:11px;color:#777} .page-break{page-break-after:always}</style></head><body><div class=\"page\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"logo\"><img alt=\"NovaWorks logo\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\"><div><h1>NovaWorks</h1><div class=\"meta\">AI Design Systems</div></div></div><div class=\"meta\"><div class=\"badge\">INVOICE</div><div><strong># INV-2026-045</strong></div><div>Date: 2026-02-14</div><div>Due: 2026-03-15</div></div></div><div class=\"box\"><div class=\"row\"><div><strong>Bill To</strong><div>Acme Manufacturing Ltd.</div><div>124 Industrial Way</div><div>Gdansk, PL 80-001</div><div>VAT: PL1234567890</div></div><div><strong>From</strong><div>NovaWorks Sp. z o.o.</div><div>Warsaw Tech Park</div><div>Warsaw, PL 00-001</div><div>VAT: PL0987654321</div></div></div></div><table><thead><tr><th style=\"width:36%\">Description</th><th>Period</th><th>Qty</th><th class=\"right\">Unit</th><th class=\"right\">Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Discovery & Workshops</td><td>Jan 08 - Jan 12</td><td>5</td><td class=\"right\">$650</td><td class=\"right\">$3,250</td></tr><tr><td>Design System Audit</td><td>Jan 13 - Jan 20</td><td>1</td><td class=\"right\">$4,800</td><td class=\"right\">$4,800</td></tr><tr><td>Component Library Build</td><td>Jan 21 - Feb 07</td><td>120</td><td class=\"right\">$85</td><td class=\"right\">$10,200</td></tr><tr><td>Documentation & Governance</td><td>Feb 08 - Feb 10</td><td>12</td><td class=\"right\">$110</td><td class=\"right\">$1,320</td></tr><tr><td>Design QA & Handoff</td><td>Feb 11 - Feb 14</td><td>18</td><td class=\"right\">$95</td><td class=\"right\">$1,710</td></tr><tr><td>Integration Support</td><td>Feb 14 - Feb 28</td><td>40</td><td class=\"right\">$90</td><td class=\"right\">$3,600</td></tr><tr><td>Custom Icon Pack</td><td>Feb 12</td><td>1</td><td class=\"right\">$1,200</td><td class=\"right\">$1,200</td></tr><tr><td>UX Research Synthesis</td><td>Jan 18 - Jan 25</td><td>24</td><td class=\"right\">$100</td><td class=\"right\">$2,400</td></tr><tr><td>Accessibility Review</td><td>Jan 26 - Jan 30</td><td>16</td><td class=\"right\">$85</td><td class=\"right\">$1,360</td></tr><tr><td>Performance Budgeting</td><td>Feb 01 - Feb 05</td><td>10</td><td class=\"right\">$120</td><td class=\"right\">$1,200</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Alignment Sessions</td><td>Jan 15 - Jan 22</td><td>6</td><td class=\"right\">$300</td><td class=\"right\">$1,800</td></tr><tr><td>Extra Support (After-hours)</td><td>Feb 06 - Feb 12</td><td>8</td><td class=\"right\">$180</td><td class=\"right\">$1,440</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"totals\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Subtotal</td><td class=\"right\">$33,280</td></tr><tr><td>Tax (23%)</td><td class=\"right\">$7,654.40</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Total</strong></td><td class=\"right\"><strong>$40,934.40</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Paid</td><td class=\"right\">$0.00</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Balance Due</strong></td><td class=\"right\"><strong>$40,934.40</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"notes\">Payment terms: Net 30. Bank transfer in USD. Late payments accrue 1.5% monthly interest.</div><div class=\"footer\">Thank you for your business. Please reference invoice number on the transfer.</div></div><div class=\"page-break\"></div><div class=\"page\"><h2>Work Summary</h2><p>This project delivered a complete design system with tokens, components, and governance workflows. Detailed artifacts are available upon request.</p><ul><li>86 reusable UI components</li><li>12 documented patterns</li><li>4 workshops delivered</li><li>Accessibility conformance to WCAG 2.1 AA</li></ul><p>Contact: billing@novaworks.example</p></div></body></html>",
  "name": "novaworks-invoice-2026-045",
  "size": "A4",
  "orientation": "portrait"
}
